            0.13
          ],
          "content": "Make the corresponding 100% stacked bar chart."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.13,
            0.88,
            0.167
          ],
          "content": "In 2005, the total unit consumption was $360+300+120+220=$ 1000 units."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.171,
            0.817,
            0.204
          ],
          "content": "The percentage share of lighting in this was $\\frac{360}{1000} \\times 100 = 36\\%.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.204,
            0.881,
            0.243
          ],
          "content": "Similarly, the percentage share of cooling, kitchen appliances, and other appliances was 30%, 12%, and 22% respectively."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.243,
            0.828,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "The calculation for the year 2025 can be done in the same way."
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
