          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "What Can We Infer?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.468,
            0.881,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "**Example 8:** The 100% stacked bar below compares the proportion of flowers blooming in Fatima’s garden and Naveen’s garden across seasons."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.538,
            0.559,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": "Proportion of flowers that bloomed across seasons"
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.556,
            0.879,
            0.672
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_16_chart_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.687,
            0.875,
            0.707
          ],
          "content": "Which of the following statements can be inferred from this chart?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.707,
            0.881,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": "(i) In Fatima’s garden, there were more blooms in the summer than in the monsoon."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.745,
            0.881,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": "(ii) In summer, Fatima’s garden had more blooms than Naveen’s garden."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.783,
            0.881,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": "(iii) In winter, Fatima’s garden had fewer blooms than Naveen’s garden."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.821,
            0.881,
            0.862
          ],
          "content": "(iv) The total number of flowers, across seasons, is the same in both gardens but it varies in each season."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.865,
            0.883,
            0.926
          ],
          "content": "(**Hint:** Find out the blooms per season in each garden if both the gardens had the same total number of blooms over the year. Similarly find out what happens if the totals are very different.)"
        }
